    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Honest take</p>
    <p>
      Many students search "career opportunities in astronomy" and find a list of observatories. Few see the number that matters: how many people are in the field. The Astronomical Society of India has close to 1,000 members, students included.
    </p>
    <p>
      A field that small cannot hire a whole generation of astronomy graduates. It can train many people well, and that training pays off only if you plan the exit.
    </p>
  </div>

