  </p>

  <div class="callout callout--amber">
    <p class="callout__eyebrow">Why a PhD is not a job guarantee</p>
    <ul class="callout__list">
      <li>The fellowship is a stipend with an end date. At ARIES it is capped at five years in total, including coursework.</li>
      <li>The next stage, a postdoc, is fixed-term and often means moving abroad.</li>
