  </p>

  <p>
    <strong>Core skill plus multiplier plus proof.</strong> Your core skill is modelling data. The multiplier is code that someone else can run. The proof is a public notebook. Together they make a <strong>high-value skill portfolio</strong> that works in or out of astronomy.
