  <h2 id="survey-era">The survey era: what AI and big telescopes change</h2>

  <p>
    Telescopes now produce more data than people can read. India has joined the Square Kilometre Array Observatory as a member country, with NCRA-TIFR as the nodal institute. Data volume is the main story of the next decade, and it changes which skills are scarce.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Task</th>
          <th>What is changing</th>
