          <td data-label="What is actually true">Research is long, quiet, screen-based work.</td>
          <td data-label="A better move">Teaching, science communication or client-facing analytics.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p>
    For most people who like science and want a higher income ceiling, data science or software engineering is the better adjacent option, because it sells directly as projects. Read <a href="/blog/career-options/mathematics-career-options/">mathematics career options</a> if the part you love is the maths. Nothing here says do not study astronomy. It says do not depend on it alone.
  </p>

